codex
I found the concrete environment defect: Lean 4.22 resolves its executable through `/proc/<getpid()>/exe`, while this sandbox exposes only `/proc/self/exe`; the numeric PID entry is absent. I’m applying a narrow read-only launcher shim that redirects only that executable-path lookup to `/proc/self/exe`. It does not alter Lean sources, generated sources, or proof terms, and I’ll preserve the diagnosis and shim source in evidence.
apply patch
