@@ -0,0 +1,113 @@
+K PROBE SOURCE
+string-probe.k
+
+K BUILD COMMAND
+kompile string-probe.k --backend haskell --main-module STRING-PROBE --syntax-module STRING-PROBE --output-definition string-probe-valid-kompiled
+
+EXIT
+0
+
+K RUN COMMAND SHAPE
+krun --definition string-probe-valid-kompiled -cPGM=<closed-token>
+
+EXACT RESULTS
+lenEmpty EXIT 0
+<k>
+  0 ~> .K
+</k>
+
+lenAscii EXIT 0
+<k>
+  3 ~> .K
+</k>
+
+lenAccent EXIT 0
+<k>
+  1 ~> .K
+</k>
+
+lenAstral EXIT 0
+<k>
+  1 ~> .K
+</k>
+
+lenCombining EXIT 0
+<k>
+  2 ~> .K
+</k>
+
+subFull EXIT 0
+<k>
+  "abcdef" ~> .K
+</k>
+
+subMiddle EXIT 0
+<k>
+  "bcd" ~> .K
+</k>
+
+subUnicode EXIT 0
+<k>
+  "\xf0\x9f\x99\x82\xe9" ~> .K
+</k>
+
+The K pretty printer's escaped subUnicode result represents the two compiled
+K characters 🙂 and é. The closed compiled literals avoid the known direct
+-c string serialization distortion.
+
+subEmpty EXIT 0
+<k>
+  "" ~> .K
+</k>
+
+INVALID CONSTANT DIAGNOSTIC
+Adding the closed term substrString("abcdef", -1, 2) made kompile exit 113:
+
+[Error] Compiler: Argument to hook STRING.substr out of range. Expected a
+32-bit unsigned integer.
+  while executing phase "constant expression folding"
+
+The frozen program never invokes substring outside
+0 <= start <= end <= length, due semantic.k lines 112-129. The candidate's
+total Lean extension outside that operational domain is therefore not used as
+evidence.
+
+LEAN PROBE SOURCE
+OperationalAudit.lean
+
+LEAN COMMAND
+lake env lean OperationalAudit.lean
+
+EXIT
+0
+
+EXACT OUTPUT
+true
+true
+false
+0
+3
+1
+1
+2
+"abcdef"
+"bcd"
+"🙂é"
+""
+
+The silent checked examples additionally establish:
+
+1. Updating an existing key preserves the unrelated binding and overwrites
+   exactly that key.
+2. Updating a fresh key preserves both existing bindings.
+3. The generated target is also provable for counterfactual bad definitions:
+   constant-true comparison, singleton/discarding map update, constant-zero
+   length, and identity substring.
+4. The actual candidate differs from each of those bad definitions on a
+   concrete adversarial example.
+
+Thus the target equation alone is not treated as bridge evidence. The actual
+definitions pass independent operational comparison: Int order is exact;
+map update overwrites one key and preserves the remainder; length counts K
+characters for ASCII, BMP, astral, and combining cases; substring uses the
+same valid half-open character indices as the frozen rules.
